<h1>ByteBazaar API</h1>
<p class="muted">Base URL: <code>/api</code> · JSON over HTTP. This list is not exhaustive — some endpoints are internal/undocumented.</p>

<div class="panel">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Path</th><th>Description</th><th>Auth</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/me</code></td><td>Current session / profile</td><td>session</td></tr>
      <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/products</code></td><td>List all products</td><td>public</td></tr>
      <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/products/{id}</code></td><td>Product by id</td><td>public</td></tr>
      <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/api/orders/{id}</code></td><td>Order detail (JSON)</td><td>session</td></tr>
      <tr><td>GET</td><td><code>/healthz</code></td><td>Health check</td><td>public</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<div class="notice">
  Recon tip: the frontend bundle at <code>/js/app.js</code> references more than what's listed here.
  Undocumented-but-live routes exist. Try a directory buster and read the JavaScript.
</div>
